# 🎓 EduTrack — Student Management System

EduTrack is a web-based Student Management System designed to simplify student record management and academic administration. It provides a user-friendly dashboard to manage students, track attendance, monitor academic performance, manage fees, and generate reports.

🔗 **Live Demo:** https://anjanabejjanki07.github.io/EduTrack-Student-Management-System/

