---

## 📖 About the Project

Managing student information manually can be time-consuming and difficult to maintain. EduTrack provides a centralized web interface to organize student records and academic information.

The system includes student management, attendance tracking, academic performance monitoring, course and department management, fee tracking, notifications, and report exports.

The application is built using HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. It runs directly in a web browser without requiring a backend server.

---

## ✨ Features

### 📊 1. Dashboard
- View total student statistics.
- Track active and graduated students.
- Monitor average GPA.
- View attendance statistics.
- Visualize students by course.
- View student status distribution.
- Access quick actions for common tasks.
- Export student records to CSV.

### 👨‍🎓 2. Student Management
- Add new student records.
- Edit existing student details.
- Delete student records.
- Search students by name, email, or ID.
- Filter students by course and status.
- Sort records by name, GPA, or newest entries.
- View individual student profiles.
- Import student records using CSV files.
- Download a sample CSV template.

### 🗓️ 3. Attendance Management
- Record attendance for students.
- Organize attendance by course and date.
- Track attendance percentages.
- Configure the low-attendance warning threshold.
- Identify students with low attendance.
- View attendance summaries.
- Export attendance records to CSV.

### 📝 4. Academic Performance
- Record internal assessment marks.
- Record assignment marks.
- Record examination marks.
- Calculate total marks and percentages.
- Assign grades based on performance.
- Identify students who need academic support.
- Edit and manage academic records.
- Export marks to CSV.

### 🏫 5. Courses and Departments
- Add and manage courses.
- Maintain course codes.
- Associate courses with departments.
- Specify course duration.
- Add and manage departments.
- Record department heads.

### 💳 6. Fee Management
- Create student fee records.
- Record tuition, examination, library, transport, and hostel fees.
- Track total fee amounts.
- Record payments received.
- Calculate pending balances.
- Record payment dates and methods.
- View fee summaries.
- Export fee records to CSV.

### 🔔 7. Notifications
- Create announcements and reminders.
- Set the intended audience.
- Publish messages for students, faculty, or everyone.
- View published notifications.

### 📄 8. Reports
- Export student records.
- Export attendance records.
- Export academic performance records.
- Export fee records.
- View summary counts for reports.

### ⚙️ 9. Settings
- Configure college details.
- Update college contact information.
- Set the low-attendance threshold.
- Export an application data backup.
- Clear application data when required.

### 🎨 10. User Interface
- Clean and modern dashboard.
- Responsive layout for different screen sizes.
- Light and dark theme support.
- Interactive navigation.
- Form validation.
- Confirmation dialogs for important actions.
- Notifications for user actions.
- Accessibility features, including labels and keyboard-friendly controls.

